schema PublicationOccurrence
generation publication-occurrence-1
authority ForeignLiveIngest + OccurrenceOrigin + InformationPolicy + RetentionGC

field occurrence_id
  type text
  required true
field source_twin
  type text
  required true
field source_ref
  type text
  required true
field canonical_href
  type text
field title
  type text
  required true
field summary
  type text
field published_at
  type timestamp
field observed_at
  type timestamp
  required true
field receipt_ref
  type text
  required true
field rights_basis
  type text
  required true
field retention
  type enum
  values ephemeral retained archival
  required true
field visibility
  type enum
  values public scoped withheld
  required true
field assertion_state
  type enum
  values OBSERVED
  required true
field cannot_infer
  type text
  required true

invariant foreign-assertion-stays-foreign
  statement every row is OBSERVED and names its ForeignTwin receipt; the observing estate did not author the publication
invariant material-is-admitted-before-use
  statement a SiteProgram may query this typed occurrence only after rights, retention and disclosure are explicit
forbidden_inference PublicationOccurrence -> Aurekai assertion, endorsement, author identity, republication right or effect authority
